WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:02.460
- Miley Cyrus has been sued
for copyright infringement

00:00:02.460 --> 00:00:05.280
for posting a photo of
herself to Instagram.

00:00:05.280 --> 00:00:08.340
This is exactly what happened
to Dua Lipa, Ariana Grande,

00:00:08.340 --> 00:00:11.040
and Justin Bieber, who all
got sued for posting photos

00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:13.560
of themselves because they
didn't own the copyright.

00:00:13.560 --> 00:00:15.630
Just because you're the
subject of a photograph

00:00:15.630 --> 00:00:17.640
doesn't mean that you own
the underlying copyright.

00:00:17.640 --> 00:00:20.190
And that list of celebrities
is no coincidence

00:00:20.190 --> 00:00:23.310
because the same photographer
took all of those photos

00:00:23.310 --> 00:00:25.470
and sued all of those celebrities.

00:00:25.470 --> 00:00:27.900
Robert Barbera has taken
photos of Justin Bieber,

00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:30.540
Ariana Grande, Dua Lipa, and Miley Cyrus,

00:00:30.540 --> 00:00:32.670
and they just couldn't resist

00:00:32.670 --> 00:00:35.430
posting those great photographs
of themselves to Instagram.

00:00:35.430 --> 00:00:36.540
And while it's counterintuitive

00:00:36.540 --> 00:00:39.000
that you can be in a photograph,
but not on the copyright.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:41.700
This lawsuit like all
of those other lawsuits

00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:44.040
is probably going to be
a slam dunk for Barbera,

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:45.720
who's probably gonna
get a nice little payday

00:00:45.720 --> 00:00:48.570
because these celebrities
don't understand copyright law.

